        "method_name": "FT-IR",
        "data_reported": true,
        "characterization_summary": "NO3^- band at 1384 cm^-1 weakens while CO3^2- bands at 1357 cm^-1, 1470 cm^-1, and 1000-1200 cm^-1 strengthen with increasing Na2CO3:NaOH ratio, confirming anion exchange.",
        "evidence_snippet": "The band at 1384 cm^-1 stands for NO3^-. As the CO3^2- increased, two new broad bands at about 1470 cm^-1 and the one between 1000 and 1200 cm^-1 occurred... a typical vibration of the interlayer CO3^2- band at 1357 cm^-1 appeared and grew strong."
      },
      {
