        "evidence_snippet": "Moreover, with a varioELcube elemental analyzer, we found that the nitrogen content of NiFe-LDH with 24:0-RT, 24:2·RT, and 24:4-RT was 0.676%, 0.413% and 0.22% in weight respectively."
