        "evidence_snippet": "The Ni 2p and Fe 2p XPS spectra are shown in Fig. S5a and b,† respectively. The oxidation states of Ni and Fe were found to be Ni^2+ and Fe^3+; the ratios of Ni and Fe remained almost the same for the three samples."
